.SS "pygments\&.lexers\&.templates\&.ErbLexer\&.get_tokens_unprocessed ( self,  text)"

.PP
.nf
Since ERB doesn't allow '<%' and other tags inside of ruby
blocks we have to use a split approach here that fails for
that too\&.

.fi
